Z||000000||kslish||11-29-2000||07:33 PM||||Since I'm starting to finally get around to updating the Western PA Fiero Club's web page at <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>  I have a question that maybe some fellow Fiero web gurus can help me out with....  <P>Our web page's online guestbook recently got wiped out so I'm wondering what is the all-around best free guestbook service available on the web?  Was using freeguestbooks.com and will probably just go back to that service if no one can suggest anything better.  Anyone using one on their page that is really neat or nice?<P>Any suggestions are welcome.....<P>Ken S.||||reg||1
